<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63683" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίψ</span></b>  (B), ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λείβω</span>) only gen. and acc. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίβος</span> being the nom. in use), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stream</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὀμμάτων
				λείβουσι . . λίβα</span> (Burges for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δία</span>) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				54
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφθονέστερον λίβα</span>
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλιτος λίβα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1454
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοιβή</span>
			, <i>libation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοσπόνδου λιβός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					292
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκταίαν λίβα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
